#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: hero actions text
#: src/en/contribute/contribute.md:5 src/en/contribute/index.md:1
#: src/en/index.md:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Contribute"
msgstr "Учествујте"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/contribute/contribute.md:11
msgid ""
"We are happy to see you contribute to Zammad! You can do this in several "
"ways. Contributions are mainly done by forking one of our repos on GitHub "
"and creating a pull request with your changes (except for translations, see "
"below). 🚀"
msgstr ""
"Драго нам је да видимо да доприносите Zammad-у! Можете помоћи на неколико "
"начина. Доприноси се углавном обављају тако што се један од наших "
"репозиторија на GitHub-у форкује и направи pull request са вашим изменама "
"(осим за преводе, погледајте испод за детаље). 🚀"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/contribute/contribute.md:16
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"You can contribute to:\n"
" * [Source-code](contribute#zammad-source-code)\n"
" * [Documentation](contribute#documentation)\n"
" * [Translation](contribute#translation)\n"
msgstr ""
"Можете допринети:\n"
" * [изворном коду](contribute#zammad-source-code)\n"
" * [документацији](contribute#documentation)\n"
" * [преводу](contribute#translation)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/contribute/contribute.md:18
msgid "Please have a look on our notes on how to contribute below."
msgstr "Погледајте детаље о томе како да допринесете у наставку."

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/contribute/contribute.md:20
msgid "All repos can be found on [Github](https://github.com/zammad)."
msgstr ""
"Све репозиторијуме можете пронаћи на [GitHub](https://github.com/zammad)-у."

#. type: Title ##
#: src/en/contribute/contribute.md:22
#, no-wrap
msgid "Zammad Source Code"
msgstr "Zammad изворни кoд"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/contribute/contribute.md:25
msgid ""
"The Zammad source code can be found on GitHub in the [Zammad repository]"
"(https://github.com/zammad/zammad)."
msgstr ""
"Изворни код Zammad-а можете пронаћи на GitHub-у у [Zammad репозиторију]"
"(https://github.com/zammad/zammad)."

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/contribute/contribute.md:27
msgid ""
"Have a look at the [developer manual](https://github.com/zammad/zammad/blob/"
"develop/doc/developer_manual/index.md) to get started."
msgstr ""
"Прочитајте [уџбеник за програме](https://github.com/zammad/zammad/blob/"
"develop/doc/developer_manual/index.md) за почетак."

#. type: Title ###
#: src/en/contribute/contribute.md:28
#, no-wrap
msgid "Supported Branches / Versions"
msgstr "Подржани огранци/верзије"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/contribute/contribute.md:32
msgid ""
"The main [Zammad repository](https://github.com/zammad/zammad) at Github has "
"several branches."
msgstr ""
"Централни [Zammad репозиториј](https://github.com/zammad/zammad) на GitHub-у "
"има неколико огранка."

#. type: Title ####
#: src/en/contribute/contribute.md:33
#, no-wrap
msgid "`develop`"
msgstr "`develop`"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#: src/en/contribute/contribute.md:39
msgid ""
"This is the current (unreleased) development state of next major release "
"(this will become the new `stable` branch)."
msgstr ""
"Ово је тренутно (необјављено) развојно стање следећег већег издања (постаће "
"нови `stable` огранак)."

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#: src/en/contribute/contribute.md:39
msgid "Don't use it for production!"
msgstr "Не користите у продукцији!"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#: src/en/contribute/contribute.md:39 src/en/contribute/contribute.md:45
msgid ""
"Supported with bug and security fixes - see also our [Security Policy]"
"(https://github.com/zammad/zammad/blob/develop/SECURITY.md)."
msgstr ""
"Подржано је са исправкама грешака и сигурносних пропуста – погледајте и нашу "
"[безбедносну полису](https://github.com/zammad/zammad/blob/develop/SECURITY."
"md)."

#. type: Title ####
#: src/en/contribute/contribute.md:40
#, no-wrap
msgid "`stable`"
msgstr "`stable`"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#: src/en/contribute/contribute.md:45
msgid "This is the current stable release, e.g. Zammad 5.2."
msgstr "Ово је тренутно стабилно издање, нпр. Zammad 5.2."

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#: src/en/contribute/contribute.md:45
msgid "Use this branch for production installations."
msgstr "Користите овај огранак за инсталације у продукцији."

#. type: Title ####
#: src/en/contribute/contribute.md:46
#, no-wrap
msgid "`stable-x.y`"
msgstr "`stable-x.y`"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#: src/en/contribute/contribute.md:51
msgid ""
"These are the branches of old versions of Zammad like `stable-5.1` for "
"Zammad 5.1."
msgstr "Ово су огранци старих Zammad издања као `stable-5.1` за Zammad 5.1."

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#: src/en/contribute/contribute.md:51
msgid "No support for bug or security issues is provided."
msgstr "Нису подржане исправке грешака и сигурносних пропуста."

