msgstr "Marienstraße 18, Berlin, BE, 10117, Germany"

#. type: Title #
#: src/en/get-started/get-zammad.md:5
#, no-wrap
msgid "Get Zammad"
msgstr "Преузмите Zammad"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/get-started/get-zammad.md:9
msgid ""
"Not using Zammad yet? You will like it! See the sections below for different "
"options."
msgstr ""
"Још увек не користите Zammad? Свидеће вам се! Погледајте одељке испод за "
"различите опције."

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/get-started/get-zammad.md:14
msgid ""
"If you have questions, feel free to [get in touch with us](https://zammad."
"com/en/company/contact) and to have a look at the [community forum](https://"
"community.zammad.org/) were you can find useful information and help."
msgstr ""
"Уколико имате додатних питања, слободно [нам се обратите](https://zammad.com/"
"en/company/contact) или погледајте [форум](https://community.zammad.org/) "
"где можете пронаћи корисне информације и помоћ."

#. type: Title ##
#: src/en/get-started/get-zammad.md:15
#, no-wrap
msgid "Testing Zammad"
msgstr "Проба Zammad-а"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/get-started/get-zammad.md:21
msgid ""
"We are sure you like Zammad! The easiest way to test it is to use a [free "
"trial instance](https://zammad.com/en/getting-started). You can play around "
"and then you can switch to a official supported instance, either keeping "
"your data or start with an empty system."
msgstr ""
"Сигурни смо да ће вам се Zammad свидети! Најлакши начин да га пробате је да "
"искористите [бесплатну пробну инстанцу](https://zammad.com/en/getting-"
"started). Можете се поиграти и на крају пређи на званичну подршку, са "
"чувањем ваших података или почети испочетка."

#. type: Title ##
#: src/en/get-started/get-zammad.md:22
#, no-wrap
msgid "Use Zammad's Hosted Service"
msgstr "Користите Zammad-ов хостинг сервис"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/get-started/get-zammad.md:27
msgid ""
"To use Zammad in production, head over to our sister site [zammad.com]"
"(https://zammad.com/en/pricing) where you can find prices for Zammad's "
"hosted services."
msgstr ""
"Да бисте користили Zammad у продукцији, идите на наш званичан сајт [zammad."
"com](https://zammad.com/en/pricing) где можете пронаћи ценовних нашег "
"хостинг сервиса."

#. type: Title ##
#: src/en/get-started/get-zammad.md:28
#, no-wrap
msgid "Self Hosted Installation"
msgstr "Инсталација у сопственој режији"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/get-started/get-zammad.md:33
msgid ""
"You can even host Zammad on your own. Read our [installation instructions](/"
"en/get-started/installation/prerequisites) and see which deployment method "
"fits your needs."
msgstr ""
"Zammad можете чак и сами да хостујете. Погледајте наше [упутство за "
"инсталацију](/en/get-started/installation/prerequisites) и који начин "
"покретања вам највише одговара."

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/get-started/get-zammad.md:37
msgid ""
"If you are a self-hosted user and want to have support at hand, our sales "
"team is happy to get in touch with you. Just leave them [a message](https://"
"zammad.com/en/company/contact)."
msgstr ""
"Уколико сте корисник који сам хостује и желите пуну техничку подршку, наш "
"продајни тим ће радо ступити у контакт са вама. Оставите им [поруку](https://"
"zammad.com/en/company/contact)."

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#: src/en/get-started/index.md:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Get Started"
msgstr "Први кораци"

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#: src/en/get-started/installation/docker.md:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Docker"
msgstr "Docker"

#. type: Title #
#: src/en/get-started/installation/docker.md:6
#, no-wrap
msgid "Install with Docker"
msgstr "Docker инсталација"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/get-started/installation/docker.md:10
msgid ""
"Zammad can be deployed using Docker-Compose. You can even use graphical "
"docker front ends like [Portainer](https://www.portainer.io/)."
msgstr ""
"Zammad се може покренути преко Docker Compose. Можете чак користити и "
"графички интерфејс за Docker као што је [Portainer](https://www.portainer."
"io/)."

#. type: Fenced div block (info)
#: src/en/get-started/installation/docker.md:11
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"\n"
"We do not provide support in terms of Docker (-Compose) or Portainer specific problems. If you choose to run Zammad via Docker, support is only provided for the Zammad application.\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"Не пружамо техничку подршку у вези проблема са Docker (Compose) или Portainer инсталацијама. Уколико одлучите да користите Zammad путем Docker-а, подршка је могућа само за Zammad апликацију.\n"

#. type: Title ####
#: src/en/get-started/installation/docker.md:16
#: src/en/get-started/installation/prerequisites.md:1
#: src/en/get-started/installation/prerequisites.md:6
#: src/en/tutorials/migrate.md:70 src/en/tutorials/migrate.md:209
#: src/en/tutorials/migrate.md:343 src/en/tutorials/migrate.md:500
#, no-wrap
msgid "Prerequisites"
msgstr "Предуслови"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: src/en/get-started/installation/docker.md:24
msgid "A working Docker Compose environment"
msgstr "Радно Docker Compose окружење"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: src/en/get-started/installation/docker.md:24
msgid "At least 4 GB of RAM to run the containers"
msgstr "Најмање 4 GB RAM за контејнере"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/get-started/installation/docker.md:24
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"- Adjust your host's settings to run Elasticsearch properly:\n"
"    ```bash\n"
"    sysctl -w vm.max_map_count=262144\n"
"    ```\n"
msgstr ""
"- Подесите ваш сервер да правилно извршава Elasticsearch сервис:\n"
"    ```bash\n"
"    sysctl -w vm.max_map_count=262144\n"
"    ```\n"

#. type: Title ##
#: src/en/get-started/installation/docker.md:25
#, no-wrap
msgid "Deployment with Portainer"
msgstr "Покретање преко Portainer-а"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/get-started/installation/docker.md:30
msgid ""
"The easiest way to get Zammad running is via a graphical docker UI. We "
"recommend [Portainer](https://www.portainer.io/). For installation "
"instructions, check out [Portainer's documentation](https://docs.portainer."
"io/)."
msgstr ""
"Најлакши начин да покренете Zammad је преко графичког Docker интерфејса. "
"Препоручујемо [Portainer](https://www.portainer.io/). За упутство "
"инсталације, погледајте [званичну Portainer документацију](https://docs."
"portainer.io/)."

#. type: Title ###
#: src/en/get-started/installation/docker.md:31
#, no-wrap
msgid "Step 1: Add Stack"
msgstr "Корак 1: Додавање stack-а"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/get-started/installation/docker.md:34
msgid ""
"In the Portainer GUI (e.g. `https://yourdomain.tld:9443`), choose your "
"target environment, select **Stacks** and choose `Add stack` as you can see "
"in the screenshot below."
msgstr ""
"У графичком интерфејсу Portainer-а (нпр. `https://yourdomain.tld:9443`), "
"идите на циљно окружење, одаберите **Stacks** и кликните на `Add stack` као "
"на снимку екрана испод."

#. type: Title ###
#: src/en/get-started/installation/docker.md:35
#, no-wrap
msgid "Step 2: Build From Repository"
msgstr "Корак 2: Инсталација из репозиторија"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/get-started/installation/docker.md:41
msgid ""
"Switch to **Repository** build method and provide the information below: - "
"**Name**: enter a desired name of the stack - **Repository URL**: `https://"
"github.com/zammad/zammad-docker-compose` - **Repository reference**: `refs/"
"heads/master` - **Compose path**: `docker-compose.yml` (default)"
msgstr ""
"Пребаците се на **Repository** метод инсталације и унесите податке испод: - "
"**Name**: унесите жељено име stack-а - **Repository URL**: `https://github."
"com/zammad/zammad-docker-compose` - **Repository reference**: `refs/heads/"
"master` - **Compose path**: `docker-compose.yml` (подразумевано)"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/get-started/installation/docker.md:46
msgid ""
"Optional: if you need to provide environment variables, you can enter them "
"in the **Environment variable** section or even upload a .env file. See [env "
"template](https://github.com/zammad/zammad-docker-compose/blob/master/.env."
"dist)  as an example."
msgstr ""
"Опционо: уколико желите да подесите променљиве окружења, можете их унети у "
"одељку **Environment variable** или чак да их отпремите преко .env датотеке. "
"Погледајте [env шаблон](https://github.com/zammad/zammad-docker-compose/blob/"
"master/.env.dist) за пример."

#. type: Title ###
#: src/en/get-started/installation/docker.md:47
#, no-wrap
msgid "Step 3: Deploy the Stack"
msgstr "Корак 3: Покретање stack-а"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/get-started/installation/docker.md:50
#: src/en/get-started/installation/docker.md:92
msgid ""
"After the stack is ready, you can access Zammad via the configured docker "
"host and port, e.g. `http://localhost:8080/`."
msgstr ""
"Након што је stack спреман, можете приступити Zammad-у преко подешеног "
"Docker хоста и порта, нпр. `http://localhost:8080/`."

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/get-started/installation/docker.md:52
msgid ""
"![Screenshot in the Stacks section and highlighted \"Add stack\".](/"
"screenshots/installation/portainer-stacks.png)"
msgstr ""
"![Снимак екрана у одељку Stacks са наглашеним \"Add stack\" дугметом.](/"
"screenshots/installation/portainer-stacks.png)"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/get-started/installation/docker.md:54
msgid ""
"![Stack creation with provided information in Repository screen](/"
"screenshots/installation/portainer-stack-creation.png)"
msgstr ""
"![Додавање stack-а са обезбеђеним подацима у Repository екрану](/screenshots/"
"installation/portainer-stack-creation.png)"

#. type: Title ##
#: src/en/get-started/installation/docker.md:55
#, no-wrap
msgid "Deployment with Docker-Compose"
msgstr "Покретање преко Docker Compose"

#. type: Title ###
#: src/en/get-started/installation/docker.md:57
#, no-wrap
msgid "Step 1: Clone the GitHub Repo"
msgstr "Корак 1: Клонирање GitHub репозиторија"

#. type: Fenced code block (bash)
#: src/en/get-started/installation/docker.md:59
#, no-wrap
msgid "git clone https://github.com/zammad/zammad-docker-compose.git\n"
msgstr "git clone https://github.com/zammad/zammad-docker-compose.git\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/get-started/installation/docker.md:65
msgid ""
"Make sure to run `git pull` frequently to fetch updates. Alternatively, you "
"can download the files from the [releases page](https://github.com/zammad/"
"zammad-docker-compose/releases)."
msgstr ""
"Обавезно често извршавајте `git pull` команду за ажурирање. Алтернативно, "
"можете преузети датотеке са [странице издања](https://github.com/zammad/"
"zammad-docker-compose/releases)."

#. type: Title ###
#: src/en/get-started/installation/docker.md:66
#, no-wrap
msgid "Step 2: Adjust Environment as Needed"
msgstr "Корак 2: Подешавање окружења по потреби"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/get-started/installation/docker.md:72
msgid ""
"In some cases our default environment is not what a docker-compose user is "
"looking for. See [Docker Environment Variables](/en/reference/docker-env-"
"vars.md) for details on which settings can be configured."
msgstr ""
"У неким случајевима наше подразумевано окружење није оно што docker-compose "
"корисник очекује. Погледајте [променљиве Docker окружења](/en/reference/"
"docker-env-vars.md) за детаље која подешавања је могуће поставити."

#. type: Fenced div block (tip)
#: src/en/get-started/installation/docker.md:73
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"If you want to use a `.env` file, you can use the provided `.env.dist`\n"
"file and copy it to `.env`. That way it will be picked up by Docker-Compose\n"
"automatically and not overwritten during updates.\n"
"\n"
"Zammad runs on port `8080` by default. If you want to use another port,\n"
"you can set it via the variable `NGINX_EXPOSE_PORT`.\n"
msgstr ""
"Уколико желите да користите `.env` датотеку, можете икористити приложену `.env.dist`\n"
"датотеку и ископирати је у `.env`. На тај начин биће аутоматски препозната од стране Docker Compose\n"
"и преживеће ажурирања.\n"
"\n"
"Zammad се подразумевано покреће на порту број `8080`. Уколико желите да користите други порт,\n"
"можете га подесити преко променљиве `NGINX_EXPOSE_PORT`.\n"

#. type: Title ###
#: src/en/get-started/installation/docker.md:82
#, no-wrap
msgid "Step 3: Start the Stack"
msgstr "Корак 3: Покретање stack-а"

#. type: Fenced code block (bash)
#: src/en/get-started/installation/docker.md:83
#: src/en/get-started/update.md:139
#, no-wrap
msgid "cd zammad-docker-compose\n"
msgstr "cd zammad-docker-compose\n"

#. type: Fenced code block (bash)
#: src/en/get-started/installation/docker.md:86
#, no-wrap
msgid "docker compose up -d\n"
msgstr "docker compose up -d\n"

#. type: Title ##
#: src/en/get-started/installation/docker.md:93
#, no-wrap
msgid "Customizing the Zammad Stack"
msgstr "Прилагођавање Zammad stack-а"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/get-started/installation/docker.md:101
msgid ""
"Sometimes it's necessary to apply local changes to the Zammad docker stack, "
"e.g. to include additional services. If you plan to do so, we recommend that "
"you do not change the `docker-compose.yml` file, but instead create a local "
"`docker-compose.override.yml` that includes all your modifications.  Docker-"
"Compose will [automatically load this file and merge its changes into your "
"stack](https://docs.docker.com/compose/multiple-compose-files/merge/)."
msgstr ""
"Понекад је неопходно применити локалне измене за Zammad docker stack, нпр. "
"укључити додатне сервисе. Уколико планирате то да урадите, препоручујемо да "
"не мењате `docker-compose.yml` датотеку, већ да додате локалну `docker-"
"compose.override.yml` која укључује све ваше измене.  Docker compose ће "
"[аутоматски учитати ову датотеку и применити измене на ваш stack](https://"
"docs.docker.com/compose/multiple-compose-files/merge/)."

#. type: Title ##
#: src/en/get-started/installation/docker.md:102
#, no-wrap
msgid "Run Commands in the Stack"
msgstr "Извршавање команди у stack-у"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/get-started/installation/docker.md:107
msgid ""
"The docker entrypoint script sets up environment variables required by "
"Zammad to function properly. That is why calling `rails` or `rake` on the "
"console should be done via one of the following methods:"
msgstr ""
"Docker извршна скрипта поставља променљиве окружења које су неопходне за "
"исправно функционисање Zammad-а. Из овог разлога извршавање `rails` или "
"`rake` конзолних команди је неопходно одрадити на један од следећих начина:"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/get-started/installation/docker.md:109
msgid "Directly execute a specific command:"
msgstr "Директно извршавање одговарајуће команде:"

#. type: Fenced code block (bash)
#: src/en/get-started/installation/docker.md:109
#, no-wrap
msgid "docker compose run --rm zammad-railsserver rails r '...your rails command here...'\n"
msgstr "docker compose run --rm zammad-railsserver rails r '...ваша rails команда овде...'\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/get-started/installation/docker.md:113
msgid "Run the interactive rails console to manually enter Rails commands:"
msgstr "Извршавање интерактивне rails конзоле за ручни унос команди:"

#. type: Fenced code block (bash)
#: src/en/get-started/installation/docker.md:113
#, no-wrap
msgid "docker compose run --rm zammad-railsserver rails c\n"
msgstr "docker compose run --rm zammad-railsserver rails c\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/get-started/installation/docker.md:117
msgid "Via \"docker exec\":"
msgstr "Преко „docker exec”:"

#. type: Fenced code block (bash)
#: src/en/get-started/installation/docker.md:117
#, no-wrap
msgid "docker exec zammad-docker-compose-zammad-railsserver-1 /docker-entrypoint.sh rails r '...your rails command here...'\n"
msgstr "docker exec zammad-docker-compose-zammad-railsserver-1 /docker-entrypoint.sh rails r '...ваша rails команда овде...'\n"

#. type: Fenced div block (tip)
#: src/en/get-started/installation/docker.md:121
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"If you need to retrieve information from the rails server, you can, for example,\n"
"place `pp` (pretty print) in front of your rails command. This leads to an\n"
"output in your terminal.\n"
msgstr ""
"Уколико желите да добијете информације од вашег rails сервера, можете, нпр.\n"
"да укључите `pp` (pretty print) испред ваших rails команди. Ово ће довести до\n"
"излаза на вашем терминалу.\n"

