msgstr "Инсталација пакета"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/get-started/installation/package.md:9
#: src/en/get-started/installation/prerequisites.md:9
#: src/en/get-started/update.md:9 src/en/tutorials/install-elasticsearch.md:9
#: src/en/tutorials/webserver-config.md:9
