msgstr "<!--@include: @/sr/modules/zammad-services-hint.md-->\n"

#. type: Title ##
#: src/en/get-started/installation/package.md:10
#, no-wrap
msgid "Supported Operating Systems"
msgstr "Подржани оперативни системи"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/get-started/installation/package.md:13
msgid ""
"For package installation, the following Linux distributions are supported:"
msgstr ""
"За инсталацију пакета, подржане су следеће дистрибуције Linux платформе:"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/get-started/installation/package.md:20
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Distribution  | Version             |\n"
"| ------------- | :-----------------  |\n"
"| CentOS/RHEL   | 8 & 9               |\n"
"| Debian        | 11 & 12             |\n"
"| OpenSUSE/SLES | Leap 15.x / 15      |\n"
"| Ubuntu        | 20.04, 22.04, 24.04 |\n"
msgstr ""
"| Дистрибуција  | Верзија             |\n"
"| ------------- | :-----------------  |\n"
"| CentOS/RHEL   | 8 и 9               |\n"
"| Debian        | 11 и 12             |\n"
"| OpenSUSE/SLES | Leap 15.x / 15      |\n"
"| Ubuntu        | 20.04, 22.04, 24.04 |\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/get-started/installation/package.md:23
msgid ""
"If your distribution is not supported, feel free to use a different "
"installation method or consider using [Zammad's cloud service](https://"
