#, no-wrap
msgid "Ensure Correct Locale"
msgstr "Обезбедите исправан locale"

#. type: Fenced div block (tabs key:distros)
#: src/en/get-started/installation/package.md:63
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"\n"
"=== Ubuntu\n"
"List your current locale settings:\n"
"\n"
"```bash\n"
"locale | grep \"LANG=\"\n"
"```\n"
"If above does not return `<lang_code>.utf8`, you can correct this\n"
"issue as follows:\n"
"\n"
"```bash\n"
"sudo apt install locales\n"
"```\n"
"```bash\n"
"sudo locale-gen en_US.UTF-8\n"
"```\n"
"```bash\n"
"echo \"LANG=en_US.UTF-8\" > sudo /etc/default/locale\n"
"```\n"
"=== Debian\n"
"List your current locale settings:\n"
"\n"
"```bash\n"
"locale | grep \"LANG=\"\n"
"```\n"
"If above does not return `<lang_code>.utf8`, you can correct this\n"
"issue as follows:\n"
"\n"
"```bash\n"
"sudo apt install locales\n"
"```\n"
"```bash\n"
"sudo locale-gen en_US.UTF-8\n"
"```\n"
"```bash\n"
"echo \"LANG=en_US.UTF-8\" > sudo /etc/default/locale\n"
"```\n"
"=== OpenSUSE/SLES\n"
"List your current locale settings:\n"
"\n"
"```bash\n"
"localectl status | grep LANG\n"
"```\n"
"If above does not return `<lang_code>.utf8`, you can correct this\n"
"issue as follows:\n"
"\n"
"```bash\n"
"sudo localectl set-locale LANG=en_US.UTF-8\n"
"```\n"
"===CentOS/RHEL\n"
"List your current locale settings:\n"
"\n"
"```bash\n"
"locale | grep \"LANG=\"\n"
"```\n"
"If above does not return `<lang_code>.utf8`, you can correct this\n"
"issue as follows:\n"
"\n"
"```bash\n"
"sudo localectl set-locale LANG=en_US.UTF-8\n"
"```\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"=== Ubuntu\n"
"Излистајте ваша тренутна locale подешавања:\n"
"\n"
"```bash\n"
"locale | grep \"LANG=\"\n"
"```\n"
"Уколико горња команда не врати `<lang_code>.utf8`, ово можете исправити\n"
"на следећи начин:\n"
